# BDP pin and lock: the gastownhall/bdp checkpoint vendored in spec/
# beside this file, and the size, sha256 and git blob id of every
# vendored file. Generated by scripts/bdp-vendor.sh; never edit by hand.
# Rules: engdocs/design/bdp.md. The pin moves only in a pin-bump PR
# approved by Julian Knutsen; a PR that adds a consumer of another bdp
# file reruns the script at the same pin. TestVendoredBDPMatchesPin
# checks the files against this lock and its format; reviewers check
# the checkpoint with scripts/bdp-vendor.sh <bdp checkout> <tag> --check.
# The lock line is the sha256 of the other non-comment lines, so two
# PRs that change this file conflict on it. Resolve that by taking
# main's bdp.pin and rerunning the script; never merge it by hand.
